<title>UK: UK gilts end lower, but helped by BoE auction news.</title>
<headline>UK gilts end lower, but helped by BoE auction news.</headline>
<text>
<p>1530 GMT - UK gilt futures end 2/32 lower on the back of falling European bond markets, but losses stemmed by Bank of England announcement that next week's auction will be a smaller-than-expected 2.0 billion stg.</p>
<p>*Sept contract ends down 2/32 at 114-04.</p>
</text>
